--[[
        GLITCH RUSH -- a mass of Glitch's cubes rushes through the rooms, skipping like a broken video

            loadstring(game:HttpGet("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bonellocristian78-lab/Gradish-Mode/claude/sei-qui-con-noi-ye4k62/GlitchRush"))()

        Glitch's sound, the lights of your room flickering: hide. A black and purple mass of cubes with DOORS' Glitch
        texture (its core, a cloud of smaller cubes jumping around it, its particles, its purple light) runs from the
        oldest room loaded to the newest in jerks: it skips ahead, stops dead, skips again. As it nears, the screen tints
        purple and fills with glitching cubes. Not hidden where it sees you: 40 damage and your screen breaks into
        cubes for a moment (at your last health, your death). At the end it glitches back to where it started and runs
        once more. Then it falls apart.

        Only you see it. Run it again: a new one (the one before goes). Outside DOORS it runs along a line through you.
]]

